index 4503002a59c1..c3fe0bf2c8b4 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,12 +9,53 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
